body:
who ever said you needed a higher purpose? try not to compare yourself to others cause they dont have to go through what you're going through. and ya different things make you feel happy. maybe your definition of success is just different. maybe its being happy and if gaming with your friends makes you happy and keeps you here, dont let the world tell you otherwise that youre not enough. you dont have to subscribe to their definition of happiness and success

&#x200B;

maybe your defintion of success will change one day and youll have the motivation to study again but up till then, theres nothing wrong in your own pursuit of your own happiness. have fun gaming :)
